  "reflectionText": "The pilgrim came up to the gates of the temple and lifted the song: shout for joy to Yahweh, all the earth. Serve Yahweh with gladness. Enter into his gates with thanksgiving. For Yahweh is good, his loving kindness endures forever. What is it to sing the same song the pilgrims have sung at this gate for generations, and to hear your own voice carry the line forward?"
